insert into kb_chunks (content, source, reference, crop, section, lang, embedding) values ('Bangladesh produced about 32 million metric tons of rice. Table shows the statistics of rice production in Bangladesh during 2007-08 to 2009-10. Aman tops the position, followed by Boro and Aus, in area and Boro followed by Aman and Aus in production. Table Area and production of rice in Bangladesh (2009-10).

