2. Active Tista Floodplain Mica and Chlorite* 3. Tista Meander Floodplain Mica and Chlorite* 4. Karatoya-Bangali Floodplain Mica and Chlorite* 5. Lower Atrai Basin Mica and Chlorite* 6, Lower Euan Siniba Mloadtatatin Mica, Kaolinite, interstratified Mica-

Vermiculite-Smectite and Kaolinite-Smectite

