insert into kb_chunks (content, source, reference, crop, section, lang, embedding) values ('30-40% in the subsequent crops after potato, sugarcane, vegetables and spices when recommended dose of K fertilizer is used. The K dose could be reduced by 20-40% in subsequent crops if 2-4 tons of crop residues per hectare are incorporated to soils. Since release of K is high in kharif season due to high temperature, potassium application may be reduced by 10- 15% of the recommended dose.

