insert into kb_chunks (content, source, reference, crop, section, lang, embedding) values ('in two splits- the one-half at final land preparation and the rest half at rapid tillering stage. Sulphur and zinc fertilizers may be topdressed if necessary, especially if the recommended dose of these fertilizers has not been applied during land preparation. Topdressing should be done under moist soil condition and mixed thoroughly with the soil as soon as possible for better utilization.

